{"3676490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PurrPlate", "steam_appid": 3676490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Purr Plate</i></strong> – Craft Your Wholesome Feline Picnic Paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come and build your dream <i>Purr Plate</i>!</strong><br>In this sunlit feline paradise, become the owner of a one-of-a-kind restaurant designed with your dream &quot;Purr Plate&quot;! Team up with over 100+ quirky cat staffers--from paw-kneading bakers to servers tumbling adorably over their own tails--to create your purrfect woodland café!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras/47c450a1269732c371138b322dfff83d.avif?t=1777357258\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676490/extras_big/47c450a1269732c371138b322dfff83d.avif?t=1777357258 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Whimsical Haven</strong><br>Start from scratch using 50+ modular components:<br>🐾 Combine rustic log kitchens with floating cloud-shaped dining platforms<br>🐾 Design enchanted garden nooks where fireflies illuminate heart-shaped scones<br>🐾 Build nap stations with dangling yarn balls for tired paws<br>Every moss-covered stone and mismatched teacup tells your unique story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Staff with Character</strong><br>Meet your unforgettable team:<br>• <strong>Grain</strong> – The chubby tabby who bakes at lightning speed...when not napping in flour sacks<br>• <strong>Spring</strong> – A hyperactive kitten delivering orders in 3 seconds flat (and breaking 2 plates)<br>• <strong>Scar</strong> – The rugged explorer who hunts rare mushroom ingredients between shifts<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay 